# Everything at the top level is ignored, and the few things the public
# repository actually holds are listed back in below. A new folder is private
# by default, which is the way round that keeps things from leaking by accident.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/modrinth-description-en.md
!/pom.xml
!/src/

# Never publish, wherever it turns up.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
INSTRUCTION.md
.idea/
*.iml
/target/
dependency-reduced-pom.xml
*.class
node_modules/

# Credentials and TLS material.
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.pfx

# Local runtime leftovers.
*.log
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
